  "content": "<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fapexhost.gg%252fZelvonn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1560248/description_d82838d9-0073-4fbe-aef0-030fe4cf566d.png\"></a></p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<strong><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><a style=\"color:#2dc26b\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fapexhost.gg%252fZelvonn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Apex 伺服器代管</a></span></strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>關於：</strong>&nbsp; Twixxel's ModPack 是一款心理恐怖模組包，旨在將《Minecraft》轉變為一場令人不安、無法預測的體驗，靈感來自於 Twixxel 的影片。你探索得越深入，世界就開始變得越發詭異。不該出現的地方，出現了奇怪的結構。不明聲響在黑暗中迴盪。有時可以看到人影在遠處凝視，然後消失得無影無蹤。你永遠無法確定自己所見是否真實，是否有什麼東西在跟蹤你，或者你是否真的孤身一人。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>影片：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#843fa1\"><a style=\"color:#843fa1\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.tiktok.com%252ft%252fZP8s5Facq%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.tiktok.com/t/ZP8s5Facq/</a></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><br><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>鳴謝</strong>:&nbsp;</span></p><h3><span style=\"color:#3598db\">感謝 Tsariulll 向我推薦了「Don't Cry」模組（主要模組）</span></h3>",
